{"product_id":"killing-pablo-the-hunt-for-the-richest-most-powerful-criminal-in-history","title":"Killing Pablo: The Hunt for the Richest, Most Powerful Criminal in History","description":"\u003cp\u003eKilling Pablo is the inside story of the brutal rise and violent fall of the Colombian cocaine cartel kingpin, whose criminal empire held a nation of thirty million hostage--a reign of terror that would end only with his death. In an intense, up-close account, award-winning journalist Mark Bowden exposes the never-before-revealed details of how U.S. operatives led the sixteen-month manhunt.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 129 x 198\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Mark Bowden\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780857891495\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 387\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45790848450713,"sku":"17RA-19780857891495","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68edeba1d3b37_Killing_Pablo-_The_Hunt_for_the_Richest__Most_Powerful_Criminal_in_History_Mark_Bowden.jpg?v=1760460595","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/killing-pablo-the-hunt-for-the-richest-most-powerful-criminal-in-history","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}